<view class="page inventory-page"><view class="eyebrow fade-in">INVENTORY / MATERIAL FLOW</view><view class="title fade-in">物料库存</view><view class="subtitle fade-in">每一件库存都要有来源，缺货也要有证据。</view><view class="inventory-hero card-dark fade-in delay-1"><view><view class="hero-kicker">STOCK POSITION</view><view class="hero-number">304<text> 件在库</text></view><view class="hero-note">4 类物料 · 50 件在途 · {{filter === 'all' ? '全部显示' : '已筛选'}}</view></view><view class="warehouse-glyph"><view></view><view></view><view></view></view></view><view class="inventory-search card fade-in delay-1"><text class="search-icon">⌕</text><input value="{{query}}" placeholder="搜索物料或编码" bindinput="inputQuery" /><button wx:if="{{query}}" bindtap="clearQuery">×</button></view><view class="inventory-tabs fade-in delay-1"><button class="inventory-tab {{filter === 'all' ? 'inventory-active' : ''}}" data-filter="all" bindtap="selectFilter">全部</button><button class="inventory-tab {{filter === 'low' ? 'inventory-active' : ''}}" data-filter="low" bindtap="selectFilter">低库存 <text>2</text></button><button class="inventory-tab {{filter === 'transit' ? 'inventory-active' : ''}}" data-filter="transit" bindtap="selectFilter">在途 <text>3</text></button></view><view class="inventory-list fade-in delay-2"><block wx:for="{{visibleItems}}" wx:key="id"><view class="inventory-card card"><view class="inventory-top"><view><view class="item-code">{{item.code}}</view><view class="item-name">{{item.name}}</view></view><text class="tag tag-{{item.tone}}">{{item.trend}}</text></view><view class="stock-row"><text class="stock-number">{{item.stock}}</text><text class="stock-unit">/ {{item.capacity}} 件</text><text class="stock-state">{{item.inTransit ? '在途 ' + item.inTransit : '无在途'}}</text></view><view class="stock-bar"><view class="stock-fill fill-{{item.tone}}" style="width: {{item.stock / item.capacity * 100}}%"></view><view class="safe-line"></view></view><view class="inventory-foot"><text>{{item.source}}</text><text class="inventory-arrow">›</text></view></view></block></view><view class="inventory-note"><text>库存摘要来自 ForgeMind 结构/运行接口。</text><text>缺货和数量事实以 Web 仿真或现场数据源为准。</text></view></view>
